<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NovaCare raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NovaCare raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co raised NovaCare Inc to buy from long term attractive, a Wall Street source said</p>
<p>-- Analyst says company has turned corner, sets $18/shr 12-month target</p>
<p>-- NovaCare unchanged at 12-5/8 in early trading</p>
